    <section class="section">
        <div class="container project full_width">
            <div class="block project">
                <div class="content-subtitle red">01 [//] The Problem</div>
                <div class="block full_width">
                    <h2>A beginning of a Journey</h2>
                    <p><strong><i>A marketing agency</i></strong> is often a fragmented and stressful process for businesses in Lima. <br><br>
                    <strong><i>e-Qapla</i></strong> identified that potential clients were losing valuable time toggling between multiple courier platforms, facing cluttered interfaces and a total lack of real-time visibility. The challenge was to created a seamless and engaging <strong><i>user experience for e-qapla, highlighting the benefits of their shipping management platform.</i></strong> Explore a clean and modern design that guides users towards action.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

