    <section class="section grey">
        <div class="container horizontal project">
            <div class="block project full_width">
                <div class="block full_width">
                    <div class="content-subtitle red">02 [//] Goal</div>
                    <h2>Centralize to Scale</h2>
                    <p>The primary objective was to bridge the gap between <strong><i>service information and user-centric design.</i></strong> We focused on three strategic pillars: <br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Simplification</strong>: Consolidating multiple courier services into a single, unified dashboard.</li>
                            <li><strong>Clarity</strong>: Prioritizing what you obtain and gain on this service.</li>
                             <li><strong>Conversion</strong>: Optimizing the user journey to turn initial interest into successful contact form submissions.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <br><br>
                        Covering every step of the process: <strong><i>[userflow, prototyping, reviews, Testing of form process]</i></strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="img-wrapper">
                <img class="img" src="/images/process-eqapla-2.avif" alt="Image of the web design process - 1">
                <img class="img project" src="/images/process-eqapla-1.avif" alt="Image of the web design process - 2">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container horizontal project">
            <div class="block project full_width">
                <div class="block full_width">
                    <div class="content-subtitle red">03 [//] onboarding</div>
                    <h2>A Frictionless Welcome</h2>
                    <p>We implemented a progressive onboarding flow to prevent user burnout. Instead of overwhelming users with long forms, we focused strictly on essential data points to streamline the initial experience. Ensuring a perfect fit for any device<br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Micro-interactions</strong>: Instant visual feedback to validate data entry and reduce errors.</li>
                            <li><strong>Validation & Automation:</strong>: Leveraged <strong>Make</strong> and <strong>reCAPTCHA</strong> to prevent bot activity and automate form submissions, ensuring seamless communication with prospective clients.</li>
                        </ul>             
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="img-wrapper">
                <img class="img project" src="/images/e-qapla-mockup.avif" alt="Image of the web design implementation on webflow">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section full-width" style="background-image: url('../images/Collage_eqapla.avif');">
    </section>
